msgstr "Opret en ny 1 GiB AnduinOS EFI-systempartition"

msgid ""
"Create and format a dedicated AnduinOS EFI System Partition inside the "
"selected space."
msgstr ""
"Opret og formatter en dedikeret AnduinOS EFI-systempartition i det valgte "
"område."

